 V_\\alpha^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is a tuple matching the free variables of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\Phi\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic satisfaction relation, applicable also to the proper-class structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,\\in)\">\\((V,\\in)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ReflectingOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ReflectingOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}reflecting\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ReflectingOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\Phi\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V_\\alpha^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl((V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}reflecting\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ReflectingOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\Phi\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V_\\alpha^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl((V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reflection is relative to a finite formula family, exactly as in the Lévy reflection scheme. Satisfaction for the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is explicitly metatheoretic; it is not confused with the set-coded satisfaction predicate for ordinary structures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\Phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a\\in V_\\alpha^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"(V,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ReflectingOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}reflecting\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8ReflectingOrdinal}_S(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\Phi\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}]^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V_\\alpha^{<\\omega}\\;\\Bigl((V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1557,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3019","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-reflecti